  "Name": "Pi-Hole Remove Commands Linux Priv Esc",
  "Description": "Pi-Hole versions 3.0 - 5.3 allows for command line input to the removecustomcname, removecustomdns, and removestaticdhcp functions without properly validating the parameters before passing to sed. When executed as the www-data user, this allows for a privilege escalation to root since www-data is in the sudoers.d/pihole file with no password.",
